OL,3,GNEWSA'Big money' drug dealer fled UK
OL,4,Abefore sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "big money" drug dealer who fled the
OL,7,FUK before he could be sentenced has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for 11 years.
OL,10,FMichael Hagan, 34, dealt in commercial
OL,11,Fscale quantities of cocaine and
OL,12,Fcannabis for three months of the first
OL,13,Fcoronavirus lockdown in 2020, Teesside
OL,14,FCrown Court heard.
OL,16,FHe admitted conspiracy to supply class
OL,17,FA and B drugs in July 2024 but went on
OL,18,Fthe run before he could be sentenced,
OL,19,Fonly returning to the UK in August this
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
