OL,3,GNEWSA'Big money' drug dealer fled UK
OL,4,Abefore sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FHagan, of Liverton Avenue in
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough, was caught after police
OL,8,Fcracked the EncroChat network on which
OL,9,Fhe used the handle Vocal Dove, the
OL,10,Fcourt heard.
